Package: tidyversindonesia
Title: Indonesian-Language Interface for Learning R and the Tidyverse
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yandi", "Andiyana", , "tidyversindonesia@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: An educational package for Indonesian-speaking beginners. It
    provides thin wrappers around functions from 'dplyr', 'tidyr', 'readr',
    'tibble' and 'ggplot2' with Indonesian function names, Indonesian
    argument names and localized datasets, so that learners can follow the
    first part of 'R for Data Science' in Bahasa Indonesia while keeping a
    clear path to standard R and tidyverse code.
URL: https://github.com/yandiandiyana/tidyversindonesia
BugReports: https://github.com/yandiandiyana/tidyversindonesia/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
